      "formatCode": "mcq_single",
      "translations": {
        "bn": {
          "questionText": "যদি $\\overset{⇀}{A} = \\hat{i} + \\hat{j} + \\hat{k}$ এবং $\\overset{⇀}{B} =2 \\hat{i} +2 \\hat{j} +2 \\hat{k}$ হয় তবে $\\overset{⇀}{B}$ বরাবর $\\overset{⇀}{A}$ এর লম্ব অভিক্ষেপ কত?",
          "solutionText": "$\\vec{A}\\cdot\\vec{B}=(\\hat{i}+\\hat{j}+\\hat{k})\\cdot(2\\hat{i}+2\\hat{j}+2\\hat{k})=2+2+2=6;|\\vec{B}|=\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+{2}^{2}+{2}^{2}}=\\sqrt{12}=2\\sqrt{3}$\nসুতরাং $A\\cos⁡\\theta=\\frac{\\vec{A}\\cdot\\vec{B}}{|\\vec{B}|}=\\frac{6}{2\\sqrt{3}}=\\sqrt{3}$"
        }
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "ordinal": 1,
          "key": "A",
          "isCorrect": false,
          "body": {
            "bn": "$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 2,
          "key": "B",
          "isCorrect": true,
